{"video":"lIc-OWx4Mhk","lines":[{"t":[0,6.6],"en":"I don't know, Monica, it feels funny just being here."},{"t":[7,11.2],"en":"I mean, if you buy a bed from Janice's ex-husband, that's like betraying Chandler."},{"t":[11.5,12.6],"en":"Not at these prices."},{"t":[18.7,19.2],"en":"Hi."},{"t":[19.8,23],"en":"You know, in England, this car would be on the other side of the store."},{"t":[28.8,29.2],"en":"Whoosh!"},{"t":[31,34],"en":"Oh, oh, oh."},{"t":[34.5,35.8],"en":"Phoebe, come here."},{"t":[36.5,38.7],"en":"Oh, this is my new bed."},{"t":[38.9,40.4],"en":"You gotta feel this bad boy."},{"t":[41.8,44.8],"en":"Ugh, Monica, it still feels so weird, you know?"},{"t":[45.1,46.1],"en":"Chandler's your friend."},{"t":[46.3,46.5],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[46.8,48.6],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[50,50.5],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[51,52.2],"en":"All right, take this bed."},{"t":[52.3,53.2],"en":"You can make other friends."},{"t":[58.8,62.8],"en":"Hey, hey, hey, hey, delivery from the Mattress King."},{"t":[65.2,66],"en":"You, Miss Geller?"},{"t":[66.9,67.3],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[67.6,68.1],"en":"Signed here."},{"t":[69.5,71.2],"en":"Ooh, do I have a middle name?"},{"t":[72,76.4],"en":"All right, Monica Falula Geller."},{"t":[77.4,78.4],"en":"Hey, it's that bedroom there."},{"t":[81.1,85.1],"en":"Hey, Monica bought a bed from the Mattress King?"},{"t":[85.3,85.6],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[85.8,88.7],"en":"So please, please, please don't say anything to Chandler."},{"t":[89.1,90.5],"en":"You want me to lie to Chandler?"},{"t":[91,91.7],"en":"Is that a problem?"},{"t":[91.9,92.1],"en":"No."},{"t":[96.5,97.2],"en":"What's this?"},{"t":[98.9,99.9],"en":"Isn't it cool?"},{"t":[100.2,101.3],"en":"Vroom, vroom."},{"t":[103.1,104.7],"en":"This is not the bed I ordered."},{"t":[104.9,105.5],"en":"I know."},{"t":[105.6,107.6],"en":"You must have won, like, a contest or something."},{"t":[110,110.4],"en":"Phoebe."},{"t":[112.5,114.4],"en":"Why is this car in my bedroom?"},{"t":[114.6,115.7],"en":"I'm sorry, okay?"},{"t":[115.8,119.7],"en":"I wasn't looking, and the store said that they won't take it back because you've signed for"},{"t":[119.7,119.8],"en":"it."},{"t":[119.8,121.4],"en":"When did I sign for it?"},{"t":[121.5,122.5],"en":"When I was you."},{"t":[122.8,123.3],"en":"You know what?"},{"t":[123.3,125.6],"en":"It's all Joey's fault because he left his nose open."},{"t":[128,129.5],"en":"Did you make brownies today?"},{"t":[131.2,131.9],"en":"Knock, knock."},{"t":[132.3,133.8],"en":"Quick, take off your dress."},{"t":[133.8,134.6],"en":"You won't notice the bed."},{"t":[137.3,138.5],"en":"Hey, I'm going for sushi."},{"t":[138.6,140.5],"en":"Does anybody want, uh, ha, ha, ha?"},{"t":[142.4,144.5],"en":"Whoa, somebody missed the off-ramp."},{"t":[147.1,148.3],"en":"It's Monica's bed."},{"t":[148.5,148.7],"en":"What?"},{"t":[149.8,150.2],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[152.1,153.3],"en":"It's a race car."},{"t":[153.3,157.1],"en":"So this has always been Monica's bed."},{"t":[157.2,158.2],"en":"You're just noticing now?"},{"t":[158.3,159.6],"en":"How self-involved are you?"},{"t":[161.8,165.6],"en":"Okay, well, if this bed isn't nude, then how come there's plastic on the mattress?"},{"t":[168.8,170.4],"en":"Sometimes I have bad dreams."},{"t":[175,176.2],"en":"Uh, may I help you?"},{"t":[176.3,176.7],"en":"Yes, hi."},{"t":[176.9,177.8],"en":"I talked to you on the phone."},{"t":[177.9,179.7],"en":"I'm the lady who got stuck with the race car bed."},{"t":[180,182.1],"en":"Look, it's like I told you."},{"t":[182.1,183.7],"en":"There's nothing I can do."},{"t":[184.2,185.4],"en":"You signed for it."},{"t":[185.7,187.6],"en":"Monica Falula Geller."},{"t":[189.1,190.3],"en":"All right, Chester, man."},{"t":[190.4,191.3],"en":"Look, we want to see the king."},{"t":[191.8,193.6],"en":"Nobody sees the king."},{"t":[195.1,196.5],"en":"Okay, I'm talking to the king."},{"t":[196.9,199],"en":"Hey, you can't go back there."},{"t":[203,214.8],"en":"Hey, watch it, lady."},{"t":[214.8,222.8],"en":"Hey, watch it, lady."},{"t":[222.8,234.9],"en":"All right, I'll leave."},{"t":[235.8,237.1],"en":"My bed's so boring."}]}
